(footprint "PCIe_x1_Edge_Fingers" (version 20241229) (generator "netsmith") (layer "F.Cu")
(descr "PCI Express x1 card-edge connector: 36 gold fingers on a 1.0 mm pitch, drawn as it is before it is flipped to the back face: the reference board's pads with every y negated and side A (A1 to A18) on B.Cu, side B (B1 to B18) on F.Cu. Placed on the back, as the reference has it, fab flips it as KiCad does: it negates every y and moves every layer to the other face, so on the board side A is on F.Cu and side B on B.Cu, as in the reference. The footprint draws no board outline: the board's outline is drawn by the physical file") (tags "PCIe edge connector x1 fingers")
